Cabal-Version: 3.0
Name:          leant
Version:       0.1.0
Synopsis:      A GHCi-style interactive REPL for Lean 4
Description:
  Haskell port of Tools/LeantPy/leant.py: an interactive read-eval-print
  loop for Lean 4 talking directly to the leanprover-community/repl backend
  (JSON over stdin/stdout), with a Haskeline front-end modeled on the Djex
  REPL driver.
License:       BSD-3-Clause
Author:        Vladimir Reshetnikov
Maintainer:    Vladimir Reshetnikov
Build-Type:    Simple

Executable leant
  Default-Language: Haskell2010
  Hs-Source-Dirs:   src
  Main-Is:          Main.hs
  Other-Modules:
    Leant.Backend
    Leant.Builtins
    Leant.Classify
    Leant.Format
    Leant.Json
    Leant.Synth.Engine
    Leant.Synth.Fragment
    Leant.Synth.Render
  Ghc-Options:
    -Wall
    -Wcompat
    -Wincomplete-uni-patterns
    -threaded
  Build-Depends:
    base       >= 4.19 && < 5,
    containers >= 0.6  && < 0.9,
    directory  >= 1.3  && < 1.4,
    djex,
    filepath   >= 1.4  && < 1.6,
    haskeline  >= 0.8  && < 0.9,
    process    >= 1.6  && < 1.7,
    time       >= 1.12 && < 1.15
  if os(windows)
    Build-Depends: Win32 >= 2.13 && < 2.15
